    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Welcome to NinjaDraw</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p>Setup is easy and takes only a few minutes.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the plugin, unpack it and upload the <strong>[ninjadraw]</strong> folder to your <strong>wp-content/plugins/</strong> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8220;Plugins&#8221; menu in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Create a new post or page</li>\n<li>Add the NinjaDraw Block from the block category called &#8220;Widgets&#8221; in the Gutenberg editor.</li>\n<li>You can change block settings from the right-side settings sidebar.<br />\nYou’re done. Enjoy.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>New: brand new redesigned version</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
